   (This is the only user-role message in the conversation. The `# TDD Red Phase` / `# TDD Green Phase` / `# TDD Test List Phase` blocks are skill definitions loaded by the Skill tool, not user turns. No security-relevant constraints were stated by the user beyond the project rules in CLAUDE.md described in section 1.)

