   - **No test-run failures were unexpected.** Every Red-phase prediction in this session proved correct — including the three genuine failures (follow-up discount 115≠100; enchantment-9 payout 900≠400; cap exhaustion third result 1400≠600) and the thrown `Error: unsupported step: claim` for the first claim test.
   - No user feedback or corrections were received in this session (no user-role turns after the original request).

